notes: >
  Equal contribution: Derek Corcoran and Pil Birkefeldt Møller Pedersen contributed equally.
  Additional equal contribution: Carsten Rahbek and Signe Normand contributed equally.

  Acknowledgements: We would like to thank the Secretariat of the Danish Biodiversity Council
  for support and graphical designer Aleksandrina Leonidova Mitseva for finalizing the design
  of the figures and tables. We also thank the following institutions for helping us retrieve
  relevant data for the analyses: the Danish Nature Agency, the Danish Environmental Protection
  Agency, the Danish Ministry of the Environment, the Ministry of Food, Agriculture, and
  Fisheries of Denmark, and private nature foundations (Denmark`s Nature Fund, The foundation
  Kaj Kjær Flora & Fauna, The Bikuben Foundation, Danish Botanical Association, The Danish Nature
  Fund, Aage V. Jensen Nature Foundation, Lille Vildmose Nature Fund).

